data: {"id": "3d3b6f7a47b04d10-thinking-parallel_evidence-1996", "run_id": "3d3b6f7a47b04d10", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 状态与生命周期**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v09/workload` 当前处于 Running 但 NotReady 状态（ContainersNotReady）。\n- 容器 `app` 处于 Terminated 状态，Exit Code=1，Reason=Error。\n- Restart Count=4，Kubelet 已持续 8 次 BackOff 事件（118s 内）。\n- 当前容器最新一次启动于 `2026-09-11T14:13:32Z`，41 秒后于 `14:13:41Z` 退出；上一次启动于 `14:12:33Z`，9 秒后退出。Pod 创建于 `14:11:24Z`。\n\n**启动命令与资源配置**\n- 镜像：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- Command：`python3 -u -c \"from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())\"`\n- 卷：`inpu", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789136043878, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

