data: {"id": "3d3b6f7a47b04d10-final", "run_id": "3d3b6f7a47b04d10", "seq": 2001, "ts_ms": 1789136062716, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v09/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod `aiops-case-v09/workload` 的启动命令 `python3 -u -c '... Path('/input/app.conf').read_text()'` 试图读取位于 EmptyDir 卷 `/input` 下的配置文件 `app.conf`，但该文件并未在镜像中预置且无外部 ConfigMap 挂载，导致 Python 进程启动时抛出 `FileNotFoundError` (Exit Code=1)。该错误导致容器反复退出并被 Kubelet 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 2s (x8 over 118s) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v09(...)` | 确认容器频繁重启且触发指数退避机制 |\n| 2 | Logging | elasticsearch | `Traceback (most recent call last): ... with self.open(mode='r'...) as f: ... FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'` | 提供崩溃时的 Python 堆栈追踪与具体错误代码，证明进程启动失败原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `exit_code: 1` | 明确进程非正常退出，配合日志证实因程序错误导致容器退出 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1` (reason: CrashLoopBackOff) | 通过监控指标客观反映容器等待状态与退出原因 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n- 证据 1 和证据 4 从 Kubelet 行为和监控指标两个独立维度交叉印证了容器处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n- 证据 2（Log）提供了确切的崩溃原因（`FileNotFoundError`），证据 3（Exit Code 1）从状态码上支持了这一失败事实，排除了资源不足或网络超时等其他可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n配置缺失（EmptyDir卷中无 /input/app.conf） → Python启动执行读取操作抛出 FileNotFoundError (Exit Code=1) → Kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启策略 → Pod 持续重启且无法 Ready\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\n异常组 `g1` 的根因为 **Pod `aiops-case-v09/workload` 的启动配置错误**。容器启动命令依赖读取位于 EmptyDir 卷 `/input` 下的文件 `app.conf`，但该文件不存在。这导致 Python 进程在启动时抛出 `FileNotFoundError` 并立即以退出码 1 终止，进而触发 Kubelet 的重启退避机制，表现为 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n*支撑证据：*\n- **证据 2** 日志中明确报错：`FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'`。\n- **证据 1、3、4** 确认了该错误导致的后果是容器持续非正常退出（Exit 1）并进入崩溃重启循环。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 54.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 54.3s (Evidence 44.5s, RCA 9.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v09/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.359, "metrics": {"run_id": "3d3b6f7a47b04d10", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.3586037158966, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83358.6037158966, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 80294.64101791382, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successfu